From 54ca551090ff70a82db65e6aa5983d1ffd6dc733 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: crazynucfan <127292955+crazynucfan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:03:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] arm64: apollo_defconfig: panic and reboot on lockups

As on negroni and rhodep: a kernel that hangs only comes back if it
panics or the watchdog bites. Turn the hard lockup detector on (buddy
mode) and make it and the soft lockup detector panic, panic on oops,
and reboot 10 s after a panic, so a wedged kernel reboots by itself.
test_lockup is there to drill each of them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/apollo_defconfig | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/apollo_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/apollo_defconfig
index db6cff3f4..a156f4cd5 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/apollo_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/apollo_defconfig
@@ -1118,6 +1118,12 @@ CONFIG_DEBUG_KERNEL=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_DWARF_TOOLCHAIN_DEFAULT=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_BTF=y
 CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ=y
+CONFIG_PANIC_ON_OOPS=y
+CONFIG_PANIC_TIMEOUT=10
+CONFIG_BOOTPARAM_SOFTLOCKUP_PANIC=1
+CONFIG_HARDLOCKUP_DETECTOR=y
+CONFIG_BOOTPARAM_HARDLOCKUP_PANIC=y
+CONFIG_TEST_LOCKUP=m
 CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=y
 CONFIG_FUNCTION_TRACER=y
 CONFIG_FTRACE_SYSCALLS=y
-- 
2.53.0

